{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1543","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔鹪鹩〕jiāoliáo一种小型鸣禽，体长约10 厘米，羽毛赤褐色，略有黑褐色斑点。多在灌木丛中活动，吃昆虫等。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10313-1"}],"blocks":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"我相信一片草叶所需费的工程不会少于星星，\n\n“I believe a leaf of grass is no less than the journey-work of the stars.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一只蚂蚁、一粒沙和一个鹪鹩","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10313-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的卵都是同样地完美，\n\n“And the pismire is equally perfect, and a grain of sand, and the egg of the wren.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"雨蛙也是造物者的一种精工的制作，\n\n“The tree-toad is a chef-d’œuvre for the highest.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"藤蔓四延的黑莓可以装饰天堂里的华屋，\n\n“The running blackberry would adorn the parlors of heaven.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"我手掌上一个极小的关节可以使所有的机器都显得渺小可怜！\n\n“The narrowest hinge in my hand puts to scorn all machinery.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"母牛低头啮草的样子超越了任何的石像，\n\n“The cow crunching with depressed head surpasses any statue.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一个小鼠的神奇足够使千千万万的异教徒吃惊。\n\n“A mouse is miracle enough to stagger sextillions of infidels.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"type":"divider"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"我看出我是和片麻石、煤、藓苔、水果、谷粒、可食的菜根混合在一起，\n\n“I see I am in the pieces of granite, and the coal, and the moss of the long-lived trees, and the fruits, and the grains, and the roots eatable.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"并且全身装饰着飞鸟和走兽，\n\n“I am stucco’d with quadrupeds and birds all over.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"虽然有很好的理由远离了过去的一切，\n\n“Though I have studied many times, I refuse to be modest.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"但需要的时候我又可以将任何东西召来。\n\n“Yet when I need to I can call on any thing.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"type":"divider"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"逃跑或畏怯是徒然的，\n\n“Running away or being afraid is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"火成岩喷出了千年的烈火来反对我接近是徒然的，\n\n“The eruption of the pent-up fires from thousand years to rage against me is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"爬虫退缩到它的灰质的硬壳下面去是徒然的，\n\n“The insect hiding itself under its hard shell is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"事物远离开我并显出各种不同的形状是徒然的，\n\n“All things separate from me and show themselves in various forms is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"海洋停留在岩洞中，大的怪物偃卧在低处是徒然的，\n\n“The ocean staying within the cave, the leviathan lying low, is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"鹰雕背负着青天翱翔是徒然的，\n\n“The eagle soaring over the mountains is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"蝮蛇在藤蔓和木材中间溜过是徒然的，\n\n“The snake gliding away through the brushwood is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"麋鹿居住在树林的深处是徒然的，\n\n“The moose hanging in the deep forest is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"尖嘴的海燕向北飘浮到拉布多是徒然的，\n\n“The sharp-billed sea-gull swaying northward to Labrador is useless.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"我快速地跟随着，我升到了绝岩上的罅隙中的巢穴。\n\n“I follow quickly, I ascend to the nest in the fissure of the cliff.”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《草叶集》上册（人民文学出版社1994 年版）。楚图南译。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"惠特曼（1819—1892），美国诗人。著有《给一个遭到挫败的欧洲革命者》《我听见美洲在歌唱》等诗歌。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《自己之歌》共52 节，这里选的是第31 节。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%e4%b9%8b%e6%ad%8c%e8%8a%82%e9%80%89-%e6%83%a0%e7%89%b9%e6%9b%bc","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%e4%b9%8b%e6%ad%8c%e8%8a%82%e9%80%89-%e6%83%a0%e7%89%b9%e6%9b%bc","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%e4%b9%8b%e6%ad%8c%e8%8a%82%e9%80%89-%e6%83%a0%e7%89%b9%e6%9b%bc","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10313,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10313-1","postId":10313,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10313-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%e4%b9%8b%e6%ad%8c%e8%8a%82%e9%80%89-%e6%83%a0%e7%89%b9%e6%9b%bc","postId":10313,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1%e4%b9%8b%e6%ad%8c%e8%8a%82%e9%80%89-%e6%83%a0%e7%89%b9%e6%9b%bc","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95